  [PASS] (2a) mu_10(y) > 0 for y>0  (transverse eigenvalue)
  [PASS] (2b) mu_10 + y mu_10' = y(y^10+2)/(1+y^10)^(11/10) > 0  (longitudinal eigenvalue)
